OL,3,CMan, 55, dies after being found with
OL,4,Cdog bite in Wakefield
OL,6,FA man, 55, has died after being found
OL,7,Fwith a dog bite following an
OL,8,Faltercation in Wakefield.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police were called to
OL,11,Fan incident off Blacker Lane in the
OL,12,FCalder Grove area on the afternoon of
OL,13,FSaturday 15 August.
OL,15,FThe man was taken to hospital in a
OL,16,Fcritical condition and died shortly
OL,17,Fafter.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/3
