OL,3,CMan, 55, dies after being found with
OL,4,Cdog bite in Wakefield
OL,6,FAnother man, 55, has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder and being the
OL,8,Fowner of a dog dangerously out of
OL,9,Fcontrol in a public place causing
OL,10,Finjury and is currently in custody.
OL,12,FDCI Michael Cox said: "Sadly, a man
OL,13,Fhas died and it is really important
OL,14,Fthat we understand the circumstances
OL,15,Fof what has taken place.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/3
