OL,3,CMan, 55, dies after being found with
OL,4,Cdog bite in Wakefield
OL,6,F"The initial altercation has happened
OL,7,Fin an area used by walkers and we are
OL,8,Furging anyone who has potentially seen
OL,9,For heard any part of the exchange
OL,10,Fbetween these two men to please make
OL,11,Fcontact."
OL,13,FPolice has appealed for two people who
OL,14,Fstopped to help the injured man to
OL,15,Fcome forward, as well as anyone with
OL,16,Finformation.
